WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.375
Andhra Pradesh one B is a village Record of Rights register. Read the extract date before treating an entry as current.

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:16.375
Use the khata and Pattadar details to connect a person to the correct village account.

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:24.625
Match the whole survey subdivision, classification, and extent. A near match is an unresolved question.

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:33.708
A one B entry does not replace the deed chain. Ask for the mutation or correction order when a change is unclear.
